after seven seasons one half of mom's  mother-daughter duo will have to face  what life throws at them  alone in early september 2020 it was  announced that anna ferris who has  starred in the highly rated tv comedy  since it debuted in 2013  wouldn't be returning for the series  eighth season that meant  her appearance on mom's april 16th  episode big sad eyes and a wrinkled hot  dog  would be her last why am i here  oh you're just in a little slump you'll  get out of it the episode was season 7's  20th  an unexpectedly final episode after  filming was cut  short due to the industry-wide  production shutdowns caused by covet 19.  at the time ferris's departure was  announced warner brothers tv cbs and  chuck laurie productions said in a  statement  from the inception of mom anna was the  first and only choice for the role of  christy  we are so proud of the stories that we  have been able to tell during anna's  seven years with us  we wish anna all the best and we thank  her for her beautiful portrayal  ferris's role as recovering addict and  single mom kristy plunkett  won't be recast meaning her exit leaves  her co-star alison janney who plays  christy's mother bonnie as the show's  sole lead in recent years however the  series about a formerly estranged mother  and daughter attempting to keep the  relationship and their lives together  while staying sober  has become more of an ensemble with  supporting cast members mimi kennedy  jamie presley beth hall william fichner  and kristen johnston  all getting their roles expanded thr  reported that ferris's departure hasn't  caused any major impact in the writers  room for the series going into season 8.  according to deadline the actress's exit  was finalized early during the show's  hiatus meaning the writers had already  planned to craft the season without  christy  while mom's creative team may have been  prepared for ferris to go  the news has left many fans wondering  why she decided to leave so suddenly  especially amid such a successful run  the announcement was particularly  shocking considering she was in the  middle of a two-year contract  which she signed in the spring of 2019  following extensive negotiations  jani inked the very same deal which  would ensure the two would stay on the  comedy through season 8.  thr noted in september 2020 that despite  the  impact of the production shutdown in the  show's 7th and 8th seasons  sources close to the production  confirmed that covet 19 concerns weren't  behind  ferris's decision to leave the show in a  statement the actress made clear that  the timing of her departure was  instead more about a personal career  move saying  the past seven years on mom have been  some of the most fulfilling and  rewarding of my career  i'm so thankful to chuck the writers and  my amazing cast mates for creating a  truly wonderful work experience  while my journey is christy has come to  an end allowing me to pursue other  opportunities  i'll be watching next season and rooting  for my tv family  at the time news of ferris's exit went  public multiple  outlets reported that her departure  would be addressed on the series when it  returned for season eight  sure enough the mom's season 8 premiere  which aired thursday november 5th  did just that christy's season 7 arc  primarily focused on continuing her  journey in law school  alongside a series of romantic mishaps  and misadventures  and the start of season eight sees  bonnie driving home after dropping  christy off at the airport  christy's headed to georgetown law  school which she got accepted to on a  full scholarship  every mom dreams of the day when they  drop their 42 year old daughter off at  the airport to go to school  and i did it all by myself janie shared  with cnn that in wrapping up christy's  story the series offers a positive  message about recovery  saying we talked about how sometimes in  recovery your life can get bigger than  you ever thought possible  and i think that's what happens for  christy fellow mom star jaime presley  who plays recovering alcoholic jill  kendall on the show  agreed saying it's really important to  showrunner gemma baker to portray a  character  that got sober and stayed sober not  somebody that fell apart and had to  start all over again  i think that was really important moving  forward  mom will focus on bonnie's feelings of  loneliness and empty nest syndrome and  place emphasis on the narrative arcs of  other characters  overall though mom fans won't have much  to worry about without ferris in tow  as tami actress kirsten johnston said it  doesn't feel that different  i mean obviously i miss anna but it's  still just mom  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite stars are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]  you
 

